            (lintegral_ofReal_norm_rpow_eq_eLpNorm_rpow (by norm_num) (high t)
        (high t).continuous.aestronglyMeasurable).symm
      _ ≤ ((ENNReal.ofReal (p - 2))⁻¹ * (ENNReal.ofReal 4) ^ (p - 2)) *
